usage: train.py [-h] [--task TASK] [--num_envs NUM_ENVS] [--steps STEPS]
                [--seed SEED] [--device DEVICE] [--headless] [--gui]
                [--buffer_size BUFFER_SIZE] [--min_buffer MIN_BUFFER]
                [--batch_size BATCH_SIZE] [--buffer_device BUFFER_DEVICE]
                [--updates_per_step UPDATES_PER_STEP] [--n_step N_STEP]
                [--compile | --no-compile] [--amp | --no-amp]
                [--save_every SAVE_EVERY] [--log_every LOG_EVERY]
                [--logger {console,tensorboard,wandb}]
                [--wandb_project WANDB_PROJECT] [--wandb_entity WANDB_ENTITY]
                [--run_name RUN_NAME] [--wandb_mode {online,offline,disabled}]
                [--wandb_run_id WANDB_RUN_ID]
                [--video_interval VIDEO_INTERVAL]
                [--video_length VIDEO_LENGTH]
                [--resume RESUME | --warm_start WARM_START]
                [--standing-height-only]

TRAINING_SIM: train TITA with mjlab physics and the existing FlashSAC learner.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --task TASK
  --num_envs NUM_ENVS
  --steps STEPS         Total vector steps, including saved steps on resume
  --seed SEED
  --device DEVICE
  --headless
  --gui
  --buffer_size BUFFER_SIZE
  --min_buffer MIN_BUFFER
  --batch_size BATCH_SIZE
  --buffer_device BUFFER_DEVICE
                        Replay device; automatically falls back to CPU if VRAM
                        is insufficient
  --updates_per_step UPDATES_PER_STEP
  --n_step N_STEP
  --compile, --no-compile
  --amp, --no-amp       Enable CUDA mixed precision
  --save_every SAVE_EVERY
  --log_every LOG_EVERY
  --logger {console,tensorboard,wandb}
  --wandb_project WANDB_PROJECT
  --wandb_entity WANDB_ENTITY
  --run_name RUN_NAME
  --wandb_mode {online,offline,disabled}
  --wandb_run_id WANDB_RUN_ID
                        Continue this W&B run ID; use with --resume to
                        continue model training
  --video_interval VIDEO_INTERVAL
                        W&B evaluation video cadence in vector steps; 0
                        disables
  --video_length VIDEO_LENGTH
                        Control steps per evaluation video (500 = 10 seconds
                        at 50 Hz)
  --resume RESUME       Restore saved environment and full learner state
  --warm_start WARM_START
                        Load network weights into the selected task; reset
                        optimizers, replay, normalization and step counters
  --standing-height-only
                        Fresh sit_stand run: keep 0.25–0.5 m goals and
                        base/knee contact termination throughout
